	<row id="msg_0335_R06R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to Saffron City, home of the\nMagnet Train!\r...That’s what I USUALLY say, but\nthe Magnet Train ain’t runnin’.\rNo power. Somethin’ wrong with the\nPower Plant. So I’m just a guy at a\fgate.</language>
